2. BUILD PROPER CHRONOLOGICAL WALK-FORWARD VALIDATION
==================================================

Do NOT rely on a single 2025/26 holdout.

Build chronological walk-forward evaluation.

Use multiple historical seasons where the required data exists.

Every validation fold must obey the deadline rule:

FEATURES MUST ONLY USE INFORMATION AVAILABLE BEFORE THE GAMEWEEK DEADLINE.

No future matches.

No future player minutes.

No future goals/assists/xG/xA.

No future transfers.

No post-deadline information.

No leakage through rolling features.

No leakage through season-end statistics.

Document every training/test boundary.

Prefer folds similar to:

Fold 1:
Train older seasons → Test next season

Fold 2:
Train through season N → Test season N+1

Fold 3:
Train through 2024/25 → Test 2025/26

Use every valid historical fold available in the dataset.

